      ],
      "title": "The study is limited by its retrospective, single-center design in a Korean population, and AGR may be susceptible to measurement variability though less so as a ratio.",
      "content": "The study is limited by its retrospective, single-center design in a Korean population, and AGR may be susceptible to measurement variability though less so as a ratio.",
