      "title": "Univariate analysis identified younger age, lower AGR, lower C3, lower C4, higher anti-dsDNA titre, and presence of anti-Sm and anti-RNP antibodies as significantly associated with increased risk of …",
      "content": "Univariate analysis identified younger age, lower AGR, lower C3, lower C4, higher anti-dsDNA titre, and presence of anti-Sm and anti-RNP antibodies as significantly associated with increased risk of lupus nephritis.",
