      "title": "Multivariate analysis showed age (aHR 0.928, 95% CI 0.895–0.961), C3 (aHR 0.977, 95% CI 0.966–0.989), anti-dsDNA titre (aHR 1.004, 95% CI 1.000–1.007), anti-Sm antibody (aHR 2.097, 95% CI 1.040–4.229…",
      "content": "Multivariate analysis showed age (aHR 0.928, 95% CI 0.895–0.961), C3 (aHR 0.977, 95% CI 0.966–0.989), anti-dsDNA titre (aHR 1.004, 95% CI 1.000–1.007), anti-Sm antibody (aHR 2.097, 95% CI 1.040–4.229), and low AGR (aHR 4.972, 95% CI 2.394–10.326) as independent predictors.",
